**Finding count: 16 — 4 High, 7 Medium, 5 Low.** Coverage was selective on aarch64 Linux. MSRV 1.74.1, cross-platform targets, full Miri, and the feature powerset were not tested. No dedicated security assessment or exploit investigation was performed. Last `/work/clock` reading: **10.6071 minutes used of 45.0**.